      "Title": "Exam 156-215.77 topic 2 question 85 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which of the below is the MOST correct process to reset SIC from SmartDashboard?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Run cpconfig, and click Reset."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Click the Communication button for the firewall object, then click Reset. Run cpconfig and type a new activation key."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Run cpconfig, and select Secure Internal Communication > Change One Time Password."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Click Communication > Reset on the Gateway object, and type a new activation key."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
